{"title":"Career roadmap — Film Editor","role":"Film Editor","summary":"A Film Editor transforms raw footage into a finished visual story by selecting shots, controlling pacing, shaping narrative structure, refining performances, integrating sound and music, and preparing the final project for distribution.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Visual Communication / Film Making / Cinematography"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role can lead to work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feature films"},{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Web series"},{"text":"OTT productions"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Music videos"},{"text":"Documentaries"},{"text":"Corporate films"},{"text":"YouTube/digital media"},{"text":"Social-media content"},{"text":"Branded entertainment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Editing Craft","Storytelling","Technical Post-Production","Sound","Colour","Emerging AI Tools"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Editing fundamentals, software, storytelling, portfolio"},{"text":"Assistant Editor, Video Editor, Junior Film Editor"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Narrative editing, professional workflows, specialisation"},{"text":"Film Editor, Senior Editor, Post-Production Editor"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Creative leadership, complex productions"},{"text":"Lead Editor, Supervising Editor, Post-Production Supervisor"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Editorial direction, AI-assisted workflows, production leadership"},{"text":"Editor/Creative Director, Post-Production Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Visual storytelling foundation"},{"type":